docs {
  # Get User Expenses (`GetUserExpenses`)
  
  **Handler**: `handlers.GetUserExpenses` in [expense_handler.go](file:///d:/Codes/budget-tracker/go-server/handlers/expense_handler.go)
  **Route**: `GET /api/_private/v1/expenses` (Private - Bearer Token required)
  
  ### Description
  Retrieves a chronological list of all expenses where the specified user is either:
  1. The original creator/payer of the expense (`expenses.user_id = userId`).
  2. A participant in an expense split (`expense_splits.user_id = userId`).
  
  Preloads the expense splits and associated participant profiles while sanitizing sensitive credentials, sorted by `expense_date desc`.
  
  ### URL Parameters
  - `userId` (string, path parameter): Target user ID (defaults to `{{userId}}`).
}
